  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *observado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to observe\" or \"to watch\" — *observar las estrellas* (to observe the stars), *observó que algo no estaba bien* (he/she noticed that something wasn't right)",
    "Also used to mean \"to comply with/follow\" (rules) in formal contexts — *observar las normas* (to follow the rules)",
    "Related: *observación* (observation), *observador/a* (observer, observant), *observatorio* (observatory)"
  ],
